# This repo builds each service from its OWN subdirectory as the Docker
# build context (see docker-compose.yml's per-service `build:` paths), so
# Docker actually applies backend/*/.dockerignore and frontend/.dockerignore
# — not this file — to those builds. This root-level file is kept for
# consistency/documentation and in case a build context is ever set to the
# repo root (e.g. a future CI/Cloud Build config).

.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
README.md
docs/
*.docx
*.pdf

node_modules/
dist/
build/
.vite/
coverage/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
deployment/gcp/.env.deploy
deployment/gcp/.db_password.local

.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
tmp/
temp/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
